              "value": "(attack)\n\nThe crocodile tucks its legs and rolls rapidly, twisting its victim. It makes a jaws Strike with a +2 circumstance bonus to the attack roll against a creature it has grabbed. If it hits, it also knocks the creature prone. If it fails, it releases the creature."
